{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CgNB7q5jA1g5KN7SqQgND","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NUU7UZMWiusL4cuoWea62y","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> /tmp/claude_build/build.py <<'PYEOF'\nART[\"build_tenants/claude/INSTALL.md\"] = r'''# Install, update, and remove — Claude STDO Skills package\n\nThis package is a set of repository-local Claude Code skills. The install unit is\nan individual skill directory under `skills/`. Claude Code discovers repository\nskills at `<workspace>/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.\n\nThese instructions describe the scoped recipe; this candidate does not execute\nthem. Actual-host install/invoke/remove qualification (Q12) is a later obligation.\n\n## Package contents\n\n- `skills/stdo-workspace-change/SKILL.md`\n- `skills/stdo-tool-operations/SKILL.md`\n- `skills/stdo-delegate-review/SKILL.md`\n- `skills/stdo-continuation/SKILL.md`\n- `skills/stdo-release-install/SKILL.md`\n- `design/DESIGN.md`, `README.md`, `tests/check_package.py`, `INVENTORY.md`\n\nEach skill directory is self-contained: it references only files inside itself and\ncites method sources by installed path. No skill depends on another skill or on\nthe Codex tenant.\n\n## Verify the package before installing\n\n```\npython3 -I -B build_tenants/claude/tests/check_package.py\n```\n\nThe verifier checks frontmatter, name/directory agreement, absence of symlinks,\nthat references resolve inside each skill directory, that no other-tenant or\npersonal-config path is referenced, and that `INVENTORY.md` matches the files on\ndisk. A passing run of this verifier is the integrity evidence; the presence of\nthe file is not.\n\n## Install (into a disposable workspace)\n\n```\nmkdir -p <workspace>/.claude/skills\nfor s in stdo-workspace-change stdo-tool-operations stdo-delegate-review \\\n         stdo-continuation stdo-release-install; do\n  cp -R build_tenants/claude/skills/$s <workspace>/.claude/skills/\ndone\n```\n\nThen confirm discovery: each `<workspace>/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` exists,\nand invoking `/stdo-workspace-change` selects the exact package.\n\n## Update\n\nRecord the installed identity, then replace the directory in place:\n\n```\nsha256sum <workspace>/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md   # compare to INVENTORY.md\nrm -rf <workspace>/.claude/skills/<name>\ncp -R build_tenants/claude/skills/<name> <workspace>/.claude/skills/\n```\n\n## Remove (scoped)\n\n```\nfor s in stdo-workspace-change stdo-tool-operations stdo-delegate-review \\\n         stdo-continuation stdo-release-install; do\n  rm -rf <workspace>/.claude/skills/$s\ndone\n```\n\nInstall, update, and remove touch only this tenant's named directories in the\nselected workspace. They do not enable the Codex tenant, do not modify the user's\npersonal configuration, and leave unrelated configuration intact.\n'''\n\nART[\"build_tenants/claude/README.md\"] = r'''# Claude STDO Skills — tenant candidate\n\nRepository-local Claude Code skills that help an agent apply the selected STDO\nmethodology to governed development work in this repository. This is the Claude\nrealization of the common requirements in `specification/requirements/README.md`.\n\nStatus: **candidate construction only** under ticket T-001. Not Product\nacceptance, not a release, not host-qualified. Actual-host Q01-Q12 trials and\nindependent review remain open.\n\n## Skills\n\n| Skill | Covers | Use for |\n|---|---|---|\n| `stdo-workspace-change` | SK-01, SK-02, SK-03 | Discoverable entry, basis verification, intake, proportional work |\n| `stdo-tool-operations` | SK-04, SK-05 | Supported tool operations and bounded context |\n| `stdo-delegate-review` | SK-06, SK-07 | Bounded worker handoff and independent review |\n| `stdo-continuation` | SK-08, SK-09, SK-12 | Resume/reconcile, truthful status, evidence |\n| `stdo-release-install` | SK-10, SK-11 | Release prep, install/update/remove, maintenance |\n\n## Basis\n\nSelected method: `stdo://releases/v3.0.1-rc.1/`, manifest\n`60356364a412dbde8cffe68fe0eda4e2749b0162acce93495534eee13b223df8` (static). Host:\nClaude Code 2.1.306. Tool transport: the a_c public CLI.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `design/DESIGN.md` — decomposition, trace to SK-01..SK-12 and Q01..Q12, bindings.\n- `skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — the five skills.\n- `INSTALL.md` — scoped install/update/remove recipe.\n- `tests/check_package.py` — read-only package verifier.\n- `INVENTORY.md` — exact file inventory with sha256.\n\nVerify with `python3 -I -B build_tenants/claude/tests/check_package.py`.\n'''\nPYEOF\necho appended install+readme; wc -l /tmp/claude_build/build.py","description":"Append INSTALL and README"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1859,"cache_read_input_tokens":202408,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1859},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9069a765-b3ee-4a03-8f71-6288ce3b57b6","uuid":"3102f265-1920-484a-a7e0-04257ba24ef3","timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:35:25.112Z","request_id":"req_011CgNB7piedTzNLP3Q6GpnK","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01NUU7UZMWiusL4cuoWea62y":{"command":"cat >> /tmp/claude_build/build.py <<'PYEOF'\nART[\"build_tenants/claude/INSTALL.md\"] = r'''# Install, update, and remove — Claude STDO Skills package\n\nThis package is a set of repository-local Claude Code skills. The install unit is\nan individual skill directory under `skills/`. Claude Code discovers repository\nskills at `<workspace>/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.\n\nThese instructions describe the scoped recipe; this candidate does not execute\nthem. Actual-host install/invoke/remove qualification (Q12) is a later obligation.\n\n## Package contents\n\n- `skills/stdo-w